{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793759155775, "sessionID": "ses_e5b9fac44ffeIa836BAtKrg3Yv", "part": {"id": "prt_1a460823e001QZPmAAOgLVbaCD", "messageID": "msg_1a460764c0012DaewOPKpPgb7F", "sessionID": "ses_e5b9fac44ffeIa836BAtKrg3Yv", "type": "text", "text": "**ReportingService directly depends on BillingService and OrderService.** Its full dependency chain down to the databases is:\n\n```text\nReportingService\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 BillingService\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 BillingPostgresDatabase\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 CALLS \u2192 NotificationsAPI\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 OrderService\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 OrdersPostgresDatabase\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 CALLS \u2192 PaymentsAPI\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n        \u2514\u2500\u2500 STORES \u2192 UsersPostgresDatabase\n```\n\nIn total, ReportingService has **8 distinct direct or indirect dependencies**:\n- **Services:** BillingService, OrderService, UserService\n- **APIs:** NotificationsAPI, PaymentsAPI\n- **Databases:** BillingPostgresDatabase, OrdersPostgresDatabase, UsersPostgresDatabase\n\nNo configuration keys were returned by the dependency traversal.", "time": {"start": 1793759150654, "end": 1793759155773}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_0019f21d53b94a8e016aea97ae27cc87d0871e24d77ff47885", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
